<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Home - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Home - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		102.53		vs	   88.51</p>
<p> Operating	    2.67		vs	    1.89</p>
<p> Current		3.10		vs	    2.27</p>
<p> Net		    1.90		vs	    1.39</p>
<p> EPS		   28.70 yen	  vs	   20.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     66 million	  vs	  66 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsui Home Co Ltd is a construction firm.</p>
